          ["Parasitology", "10% formalin or 70% alcohol for worms", "Chilled for faeces", "Faeces, adult worms, smears, scrapings", "Air-dry and methanol-fix blood smears"],
          ["Suspected gout", "ABSOLUTE ALCOHOL", "Room temperature", "Affected tissue with deposits", "Urates DISSOLVE in aqueous formalin"]
