          ["Suspected poisoning", "Liver, kidney, rumen contents, feed, water, bait + CONTROL", "Clean glass, frozen, sealed and signed, chain of custody"],
          ["Abortion", "Fetus, fetal stomach contents and PLACENTA", "Chilled; placenta carries the diagnostic lesion"],
          ["Suspected Marek's / IBD", "Nerves, bursa of Fabricius, spleen, liver", "Formalin for histopathology; fresh for virology"]
